            },
            "description": "Upload a mentor CSV. The raw body is text/csv.\nColumns: name, email, skills (semicolon-separated), experience (years).\n\n⚠ Requires S3 — will fail locally."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "_postman_id": "11000005-0000-0000-0000-000000000002",
          "name": "Export Bookings",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "x-admin-id",
